{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id143570569"}, "name":{"label":"Kortni_Grace"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-12T10:09:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.71.0"}, "id":{"label":"14541803771"}, "title":{"label":"Highly Recommend this App - Used For Years"}, "content":{"label":"I have personally had this app for a few years now and can give it an honest opinion. I don’t take it out every single day, but I do use it dozens of times throughout the year. It’s always nice to be able to see what tree or bush or plant I’m trying to identify to consider it in my own yard. It’s also become very handy in helping me to confirm what I think something is. I’ve gotten better at identifying all kinds of plants this way. My kids and husband will ask all the time for me to pull out my app to help them out. Whenever I take it out to identify something, people are always quick to ask me what I’m using and are amazed with the results. Highly recommend for anyone who is interested.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1252497129&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
